<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1250 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1250 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.1250 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.2001 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 19		  Mar 18</p>
<p> High			     75.1511		 75.2500</p>
<p> Low				75.1000		 75.1950</p>
<p> Open			     75.1500		 75.1950</p>
<p> Close			    75.1250		 75.2001</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     4.285		   2.060</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
